admin":false},"open_issues":345,"closed_issues":2336,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T08:21:32Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":6,"created_at":"2026-10-01T22:38:57Z","updated_at":"2026-10-05T19:24:01Z","closed_at":"2026-10-05T15:59:33Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in 4.8-dev7\n- Not reproducible in 4.7.2 stable\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 11 - 4.8-dev7 - Compatibility - RX 9070 XT driver 26.9.2\n\n### Issue description\n\nI recreated the same simple scene from scratch in both versions 4.7.2 and 4.8-dev7 and observed that the 4.8-dev7 is performing slower when selecting nodes. The inspector panel on the right side has a 1 second delay in version 4.8-dev7 when switching from one node to another. Version 4.7.2 stable performs much faster.\n\n<img width=\"3839\" height=\"2079\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4e028403-c9f6-40a6-a4de-36f24783cbcb\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Use the MRP\n\nor \n\n1. Create a simple scene with two MeshInstance3D nodes and expand options like Mesh, Material, Albedo, and change colors to differentiate between the two meshes, so it easier to see the delay.\n\n2. Switch between the nodes. Observe the Inspector panel having one second delay in version 4.8-dev7 but not in version 4.7.2 when selecting the other node. \n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n\n[test_4_7_2.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/32936893/test_4_7_2.zip)\n\n[test_4_8_dev_7.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/32936894/test_4_8_dev_7.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubuserc